   "path": "SCENE.md",
   "role": "instructions",
   "content": "# Shader Warp Rose Gold\n\nSatin rose-gold folds with a soft sheen. A WebGL shader backdrop; the rose-gold preset of shader-warp.\n\nCategory: shaders. Length: 5.0 s. WebGL: yes.\n\nUse when:\n- A soft satin backdrop for beauty, fashion or lifestyle products.\n- The frame is light, so dark foreground text and UI stay readable on top.\n- You want a finished Warp look without tuning the palette and parameters yourself.\n\nAvoid when:\n- The video must use your brand colors: start from `shader-warp` and set `colors`.\n- You want a darker, contrasting mood from the same shader: use `shader-warp-acid`.\n\nVariables:\n- colors (string): Colors, default \"#2a1515, #b76e79, #f6d1c1\"\n- speed (number, 0-8): Speed, default 3\n- shape (enum): Pattern, default \"checks\"\n- proportion (number, 0-1): Proportion, default 0.5\n- softness (number, 0-2): Softness, default 1\n- distortion (number, 0-1): Distortion, default 0.1\n- swirl (number, 0-1): Swirl, default 0.9\n- swirl_iterations (number, 1-20): Swirl iterations, default 6\n- shape_scale (number, 0-1): Pattern scale, default 0.25\n- rotation (number, 0-360): Rotation, default 0\n- scale (number, 0.1-4): Scale, default 2\n- offset_x (number, -2-2): Offset X, default 0\n- offset_y (number, -2-2): Offset Y, default 0\n- resolution (number, 0.25-1): Resolution, default 0.5\n\nSource: https://github.com/Remocn/remocn. Licence: MIT. The scene file keeps the upstream notice.\n"
